<title>NETHERLANDS: BolsWessanen dip after takeover denial.</title>
<headline>BolsWessanen dip after takeover denial.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch food and drinks group BolsWessanen NV shed some early gains after the company said it had no indication it was the target of a takeover bid.</p>
<p>The shares gained 1.60 to 30.20 guilders on talk that British drinks group Grand Metropolitan was angling for a takeover, but fell back 60 cents after the shares were suspended for 15 minutes for a BolsWessanen statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Given speculation in an English daily newspaper ... about a possible takeover of Koninklijke BolsWessanen NV, we announce that we do not have any indications of this (takeover bid),&quot; the company said. -- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
